flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Set inSleepMode false]
    B --> C[Print waking up message]

    C --> D[Get wakeup reason]

    D --> E{Wakeup reason}

    E -- GPIO EXT0 --> F[Print GPIO wakeup message]
    E -- TIMER --> G[Print timer wakeup message]
    E -- Other --> H[Print other wakeup message]

    F --> I[Store cycle start time]
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[Set OLED active flag true]
    J --> K([End])
